consistency and accuracy. Ensure that...\n\n**Dependencies:** \"Establish Real-Time Data Ingestion Pipeline\" (`882b0dbf-beab-4d50-9e34-b055b4ef1635`)\n\n### Task 3: Implement Route Optimization Algorithm\n\n**ID:** `41139fb3-7992-47a6-b58f-6576d1ccdaae`\n**Description:** Develop AI models to compute optimal travel routes based on traffic, distance, and time.\n\n**Notes:** Optimize for minimal travel time and distance while considering traffic congestion.\n\n**Implementation Guide:** Implement graph-based algorithms (e.g., Dijkstra's or A*) or reinforcement learning models to comput...\n\n**Verification Criteria:** Test route optimization by comparing predicted routes with actual user-reported routes. Measure accu...\n\n**Dependencies:** \"Develop Real-Time Data Processing Engine\" (`99af429c-b37f-4f15-836f-0d72fbeba438`)\n\n### Task 4: Build Real-Time Feedback Dashboard\n\n**ID:** `88c2525a-9926-4dc2-b422-520d03f644dd`\n**Description:** Create a dashboard to display live route suggestions and predictive analytics for users.\n\n**Notes:** Ensure responsive design and low-latency updates for real-time feedback.\n\n**Implementation Guide:** Develop a real-time visualization dashboard using React or similar framework. Display live route sug...\n\n**Verification Criteria:** Validate dashboard performance by measuring update latency and user interaction response time. Confi...\n\n**Dependencies:** \"Implement Route Optimization Algorithm\" (`41139fb3-7992-47a6-b58f-6576d1ccdaae`)\n\n### Task 5: Validate System Performance and Accuracy\n\n**ID:** `148d71d2-817e-48fa-8e9a-56ed1411440c`\n**Description:** Evaluate the overall efficiency and real-time capability of the solution using defined metrics.\n\n**Notes:** Ensure the system meets sub-second latency requirements and handles high-throughput data streams.\n\n**Implementation Guide:** Establish performance metrics (route accuracy, time reduction, system latency) and conduct validatio...\n\n**Verification Criteria:** Confirm that the system meets all performance requirements and provides accurate route optimization ...\n\n**Dependencies:** \"Build Real-Time Feedback Dashboard\" (`88c2525a-9926-4dc2-b422-520d03f644dd`), \"Implement Route Optimization Algorithm\" (`41139fb3-7992-47a6-b58f-6576d1ccdaae`)\n\n\n## Dependency Management\n\n- Dependencies can be set using task names or task IDs\n- Minimize the number of dependencies, only set direct prerequisite tasks\n- Avoid circular dependencies, ensure the task graph is directed and acyclic\n- Balance the critical path, optimize possibilities for parallel execution\n\n## Decision Points\n\n- If task splitting is found unreasonable: call \"split_tasks\" again to adjust\n- If task splitting is confirmed to be sound: generate execution plan, determine priorities\n\n**Severe Warning** Each time you call split_tasks, the parameters you pass cannot exceed 5000 characters. If it exceeds 5000 characters, please call the tool multiple times to complete\n\n**If there are remaining tasks, please continue to call \"split_tasks\"**\n",
